                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Key Driver</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Professional Care received the highest average ratings, suggesting that patients place significant value on courteous, professional interactions with providers.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
