                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Improvement Opportunity</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Recommendation rates remain lower than overall patient satisfaction, indicating opportunities to strengthen patient experience beyond clinical care.</run>
